  "bio": "Welcome to Tattooooze, where artistry meets the skin in the heart of London. Specializing in delicate floral, intricate illustrative, and expressive sketch-style tattoos, our studio offers a unique canvas for your personal expression. Step into our creative haven at 4 Burnt Ash Road, Lee, where your vision comes to life Monday to Saturday, from 9 AM to 6 PM.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom\n\n2026 Just Walk in \n9:30am to 4:30pm Mon to Sat \n07950-300-470 WhatsApp for prices. \nTattoos from £40 - Piercings from £15\nTattooooze@gmail.",
